    given-names: Kb
title: "Smart Stock (智慧選股): An honest, self-hostable Taiwan-stock research workbench"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-02
url: "https://github.com/KbWen/smart-stock"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KbWen/smart-stock"
abstract: "A self-hostable research workbench for the Taiwan stock market (TWSE / TPEX). Its differentiator is honesty and transparency, not prediction accuracy: it computes technical scores and an optional ensemble-ML buy-signal probability, but discloses model health and shows N/A rather than fabricating a number when the model is untrained or has insufficient discriminative power. Includes a saveable/comparable backtest Strategy Lab, an explainable per-signal score breakdown, a transparency panel, and a reproducible end-to-end data-to-evaluation pipeline. Runs offline with a bundled demo dataset."
keywords:
  - taiwan-stock
  - twse
  - tpex
  - stock-screener
  - backtesting
  - machine-learning
  - technical-analysis
  - transparency
  - fastapi
  - react
  - self-hosted
